#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:56
msgid " GSOC Ideas List and previous year GSoC projects"
msgstr "GSOC 创意列表与往年 GSoC 项目"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:5 bc4d120a5c8d49dcbad4facd495e3df8
msgid "GSoC - Google Summer of Code"
msgstr "GSoC - 谷歌代码之夏"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:6 00c8168078354de1859161a099126e00
msgid ""
"Each year, ArduPilot participates in the `Google Summer of Code program "
"<https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/>`__, encouraging students and others "
"to contribute to the ArduPilot codebase."
msgstr ""
"每年，ArduPilot 都会参与 `谷歌代码之夏项目 "
"<https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/>`__，鼓励学生和其他人向 ArduPilot 代码库贡献。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:8 c4dbc853d2304ae1a07dd6f6e77ae2a1
msgid ""
"The development team includes experienced mentors who will help students "
"make great contributions to ArduPilot."
msgstr "开发团队包含经验丰富的导师，将帮助学生为 ArduPilot 做出出色的贡献。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:10 9180d063d18a4cfa8cede2b9791ef185
msgid "To help you get started:"
msgstr "帮助您入门的资源："

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:12 42093dc8569644779ba0cb8002f3a9c8
msgid ""
"The `timeline for GSoC 2026 is here <https://developers.google.com/open-"
"source/gsoc/timeline>`__"
msgstr ""
"`GSoC 2026 的时间表在此 <https://developers.google.com/open-"
"source/gsoc/timeline>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:13 8b2ff0eebe1d45489cfc07ab18ce21d5
msgid ""
"The :ref:`suggested projects list and previous year GSoC projects <gsoc-"
"ideas-list>` is here. This is a list of our ideas of what would be good to "
"work on, but we are open to other suggestions you make in your application."
msgstr ""
":ref:`建议项目列表及往年 GSoC 项目 <gsoc-ideas-list>` "
"在此。这是我们认为值得开展的项目创意列表，但我们也欢迎您在申请中提出其他建议。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:15 c015913031b0485981f17afc683172b7
msgid ""
"The purpose of GSoC is to help people become long-term contributors. We want"
" people to stay in the community after the term."
msgstr "GSoC 的宗旨是帮助人们成为长期贡献者。我们希望参与者在项目期结束后继续留在社区中。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:17 bc90e1367d1541eda301bdaa6c5347ed
msgid ""
"The #GSOC channel in the `ArduPilot Discord server "
"<https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ is a good place to ask questions about "
"our GSOC program, submit ideas for projects, etc. Mentors will respond to "
"your posts in this GSoC channel."
msgstr ""
"`ArduPilot Discord 服务器 <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 中的 #GSOC 频道是询问 "
"GSoC 项目问题、提交项目创意等的好地方。导师将在该 GSoC 频道中回复您的帖子。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:18 0382ef9889af42fd973ec35e48d1b5e6
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ArduPilot Wiki <ardupilot:home>` and, specifically, the "
":ref:`ArduPilot Developers Wiki <dev:home>` are good sources of information "
"on ArduPilot and how to contribute to its code."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ArduPilot Wiki <ardupilot:home>`，尤其是 :ref:`ArduPilot 开发者 Wiki "
"<dev:home>`，是了解 ArduPilot 及如何贡献代码的良好信息来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:19 e097c24c301044a9aa46949cd78c25ba
msgid ""
"The `ArduPilot Discuss Forum GSoC category "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/google-summer-of-code/131>`__ is for GSoC "
"topics and should be cross-posted to the #GSoC Discord channel."
msgstr ""
"`ArduPilot 讨论论坛 GSoC 分类 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/google-summer-of-"
"code/131>`__ 用于 GSoC 相关话题，并应同步转发至 Discord 的 #GSoC 频道。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:20 bce50a8c5a6c4841b5643a6d6dbe7185
msgid "Check out the `Blog <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/blog>`__."
msgstr "请查看 `博客 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/blog>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:21 b5203737583144bf8e733fcfc136b5f7
msgid ""
"Past conference talks are on the `ArduPilot YouTube channel "
"<https://www.youtube.com/@ardupilot19/playlists>`__."
msgstr ""
"往届大会演讲视频见 `ArduPilot YouTube 频道 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/@ardupilot19/playlists>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:24 5f0908e09104453da302d765609c47cf
msgid "Advice for proposals"
msgstr "提案建议"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:26 0c3ec0263bc24debb007272a87df70cf
msgid ""
"Please note that there are likely to be more students applying than the "
"number of places Google allocates, so to improve your chances, please "
"include:"
msgstr "请注意，申请人数可能超过 Google 分配的名额，因此为提高成功几率，请在申请中包含以下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:28 ffd60615ab2c4c1988e67f69259075f8
msgid ""
"Above all, we welcome folks already working with ArduPilot who have not yet "
"submitted open-source contributions."
msgstr "最重要的是，我们欢迎已经在使用 ArduPilot 但尚未提交过开源贡献的朋友。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:29 7cd0a77195234cd0b6ace6f2e38503f2
msgid ""
"Information on how you would approach the project, what time you can put "
"into it, and what you think you can achieve over the GSoC period."
msgstr "关于您将如何推进项目、可投入的时间，以及您认为在 GSoC 期间能够实现的成果的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:30 9fa53d98485945aa94bbb3f271abf992
msgid ""
"Information on the tools you will need to complete the project, including "
"demonstrated ability in the relevant programming language or environment, "
"and details of past open-source projects you have contributed to."
msgstr "关于完成项目所需工具的信息，包括在相关编程语言或环境中已证明的能力，以及您曾参与贡献的开源项目的详细情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:31 4ccbbea41e234071b8c319fb96d71bc3
msgid ""
"Enthusiasm for your chosen project. The best projects stand on their own, "
"regardless of GSoC."
msgstr "对所选项目的热情。最好的项目无论是否参与 GSoC 都能独立成立。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:32 9d345058c54a41e7a56ffa86090e0ca8
msgid ""
"A feature and development motivation: what is missing today and why it "
"matters to the ArduPilot ecosystem and community."
msgstr "功能与开发动机：当前缺少什么，以及它为何对 ArduPilot 生态系统和社区重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:33 cbbc9d035fbe4a4ab143f0e0a3068be9
msgid ""
"A short note on what already exists in ArduPilot that can be used as a "
"foundation."
msgstr "简要说明 ArduPilot 中已有哪些可作为基础的内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:34 a39671e590d84e6fbd0f9dd8e9bb5d45
msgid ""
"A basic sketch of your proposed solution so we can see your current level of"
" understanding of the codebase."
msgstr "对所提解决方案的基本构想，以便我们了解您当前对代码库的理解程度。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:35 c69b24c56e0c45f9b147e5308e164f47
msgid "A working plan with a timeline, end goals, and stretch goals."
msgstr "包含时间表、最终目标和进阶目标的工作计划。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:36 c369e4e155cc4a65938ca8fb56ea2c11
msgid ""
"A plan for your continued involvement with ArduPilot even if the GSoC "
"project is not selected."
msgstr "即使 GSoC 项目未被选中，您也将持续参与 ArduPilot 的计划。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:37 ce2b95f4d06441669a7ee4381d5b022f
msgid "Images, diagrams, or schematics that support your idea."
msgstr "支持您想法的图片、图表或原理图。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:38 415f772125bd4bbd94bcd0fea6a202f7
msgid "Your education background, and your near-term career ambitions."
msgstr "您的教育背景以及近期职业规划。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:39 00d23be14c09430d917917994414c8ec
msgid ""
"Recent relevant work history, including whether you are working this summer."
msgstr "近期相关工作经历，包括今年夏天是否在工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:40 9eaa71d8fd034bbb96b4791c3cad5fc3
msgid ""
"Your availability for the term, where you will be located, and any holiday "
"plans during the term."
msgstr "您在项目期内的时间安排、所在地点，以及期间的任何假期计划。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:41 5abc562e61f242e3a3203315aaf70067
msgid ""
"Previous contributions to ArduPilot, related open-source work, or relevant "
"community activity, with links or other evidence."
msgstr "此前对 ArduPilot 的贡献、相关的开源工作或相关的社区活动，并附上链接或其他证明。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:43 5635517c277c4a6694c45be0a8ffd82b
msgid "Helpful resources:"
msgstr "有用的资源："

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:45 559236d78b9a4f11b1c64e39987bb03d
msgid ""
"`Learning the codebase <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/learning-the-"
"ardupilot-codebase.html>`__: a short start for how the repo is organized."
msgstr ""
"`了解代码库 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/learning-the-ardupilot-"
"codebase.html>`__：关于代码仓库组织方式的简短入门。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:46 fc7f62d8fb044c0fba19f02451ae471d
msgid ""
"`ArduPilot SITL <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-"
"the-loop.html>`__: our simulation tool; help us improve the SITL "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"`ArduPilot SITL <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-"
"the-loop.html>`__：我们的仿真工具；欢迎帮助我们改进 SITL 文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:47 e02c94b5e738440c9e8b3f6f7cf0c715
msgid ""
"`SITL with Gazebo <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.html>`__:"
" extend SITL to physics simulators, including the free and open-source "
"Gazebo simulator."
msgstr ""
"`SITL 与 Gazebo <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.html>`__：将 "
"SITL 扩展到物理仿真器，包括免费且开源的 Gazebo 仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:48 255c9ea16ea04aae948fc6ed8db1660c
msgid ""
"`Methodic Configurator "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MethodicConfigurator>`__: if you have your own"
" hardware, this is our recommended setup and configuration tool."
msgstr ""
"`Methodic Configurator "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MethodicConfigurator>`__：如果您有自己的硬件，这是我们推荐的设置与配置工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:50 7df746cf96d1414b83d07cc633a8235c
msgid ""
"Please note that having existing PRs or solving issues is not a requirement "
"for GSoC, and we do not track issue counts. If you are interested, please "
"feel free to work on a few open items for your own learning."
msgstr ""
"请注意，拥有已提交的 PR 或解决过 issue 并不是 GSoC 的必要条件，我们也不统计 issue "
"数量。如果您有兴趣，欢迎自行处理一些待解决的事项以促进学习。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:52 43fa1e125bf84fe1982e329b38601a54
msgid ""
"Do not ask to be assigned an issue or ask how or where to contribute. Please"
" follow ArduPilot standards for commit quality, code style, and comments."
msgstr "请勿要求为您分配 issue，也不要询问如何或在哪里贡献。请遵循 ArduPilot 在提交质量、代码风格和注释方面的标准。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:54 a91da73b4a2c41bfab757ced404f20be
msgid ""
"If you'd like to discuss your project or ask questions, please create a "
"thread in the `#GSOC category on the ArduPilot forum "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/google-summer-of-code>`__. Please read the "
"pinned message there before posting."
msgstr ""
"如果您想讨论您的项目或提问，请在 `ArduPilot 论坛的 #GSOC 分类 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/google-summer-of-code>`__ "
"中创建帖子。发帖前请先阅读该分类的置顶消息。"

